    // tops of small moving waves, NOT foam/whitecaps. Thresholded on the
    // SAME waveHeight driving the color/normal above, so it only ever
    // appears on genuinely strong positive crests (a soft threshold, not
    // the whole positive half of the field) and moves/fragments/reforms
    // with that exact motion -- never a static overlay pulsing in place.
