    // and position already come from the same large-scale, organically
    // interfering Tier 1/2 normal driving the color and normal above, so
    // it moves and reshapes with the same "breathing" surface rather
    // than animating on its own separate clock -- this IS "reflections
    // attached to the moving waves," structurally rather than
    // approximated. waveTone (the same crest/trough value driving color)
    // brightens the highlight on crests; the modulation range below is
    // widened from the previous pass (was 0.7-1.3) so the reflection's
    // own appear/disappear/stretch cycle reads more clearly as it rides
